  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Education Sector Development Project (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objectives are: (a) to increase enrollment and completion in primary education; (b) improve learning achievement in primary education; (c) increase enrollment in secondary education; (d) build capacity in the education sector, including for ECCD, TVET, higher education, Non-Formal Education, and MOET core functions.</narrative>
  </description>
